  "description": "After Sae-ah loses her parents to arson, the accident leaves her with the ability to see smells. Another fire puts her in the path of police officer Pyeongan Kim. Though he doesn’t believe in her ability at first, the two team up to solve cases, and he quickly realizes the power Sae-ah holds. Although her ability helps her solve all kinds of crimes, she’s yet to solve the biggest mystery of them all: who killed her parents? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS) \n\n*Note: The physical volumes only compile the first 62 chapters, five parts*",
